[{"client_msg_id":"73c57892-2c02-4162-8c0a-9da2a757b786","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"\u003chttp://mtgwiki.com/wiki/%E7%A1%AC%E9%8E%A7%E3%81%AE%E5%A4%A7%E7%BE%A4/Scute_Swarm\u003e\nちなみにこやつを使ってました\n\u0026gt; 倍々で非常に大量のスタックが処理されるため、\u003chttp://mtgwiki.com/wiki/MTG%E3%82%A2%E3%83%AA%E3%83%BC%E3%83%8A|MTGアリーナ\u003eでは警告が表示されたり、処理に大きな負荷が掛かりやすい点は注意が必要。特にミラーマッチなどでは\u003chttp://mtgwiki.com/wiki/%E6%88%A6%E9%97%98|戦闘\u003eの\u003chttp://mtgwiki.com/wiki/%E3%83%96%E3%83%AD%E3%83%83%E3%82%AF|ブロック\u003e指定が制限時間内に指定しきれないなどの問題も発生し得る。\n\u0026gt; サーバー処理負荷が大きく、他のプレイヤーのマッチにも影響を与えていたためにMTGアリーナでのトークン生成数に制限をかける要因となった。\nわろたｗ","ts":"1626258986.181500","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"ultrafastparrot","count":2,"users":["U9S4G0LJW","U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"w3c"}]},{"client_msg_id":"aaea2653-f320-49a1-bc80-52f180fa2763","type":"message","user":"UH4HCS30U","text":"MTGA, GeforceNow のフリープラン使えば端末のマシンリソース食わずに遊べるということに気づいたので最近それでやってます","ts":"1626258900.180900","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"eyes","count":2,"users":["UG6DF6W87","U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"b0+u/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3bf156b4-6cf1-497e-9f6c-a4438d0cb53c","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"なんならもっかい2倍に増やせたので処理落ちしなけりゃ 1000 並びましたね...","ts":"1626258841.180100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QyHO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"af3823ba-543e-44ae-9e1f-a0fb95013fad","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"500体並べられるのか…","ts":"1626258765.179500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gjgN"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f73f2b27-70df-4400-a9d9-bd2b89454053","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"バイバイン","ts":"1626258656.178800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"